<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060G00MX" category="C" type-id="800KH" name-id="442ON-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1241/41</dtccode>
<dtcname>Low or High Voltage Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060G00MX_05" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007PD00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>If there is a malfunction in the power source circuit, the skid control computer (built into the actuator) outputs a DTC and prohibits operation as a fail-safe.</ptxt>
<ptxt>This code is stored if the voltage to terminal IG1 goes outside the range of the DTC detection condition due to a malfunction in the power source or charging circuit, such as the battery or alternator circuit.</ptxt>
<ptxt>When the voltage to terminal IG1 returns to normal, the DTC is cleared.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.02in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.69in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1241/41</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>At a vehicle speed of 3km/h or more, IG1 terminal voltage remains below 9.5V for 10 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>While the solenoid relay remains ON, IG1 terminal voltage drops below 9.5V and the relay contact remains OFF for 0.2 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>With IG1 terminal voltage below 9.5V, the vehicle speed sensor power source voltage remains low for 60 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>While the motor relay is ON and the fail-safe motor relay is ON, IG1 terminal voltage remains below 9.5V with the actuator pump drive motor OFF for 0.2 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>IG1 terminal voltage remains higher than 17.4V for 0.8 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Alternator (regulator)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open in wire harness</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector contact pressure, terminal deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Power source circuit in skid control computer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
